  "name": "Ford Transit Jumbo L4H3 — full-time off-grid (12 V, 400 Ah LiFePO4)",
  "description": "2017 Ford Transit Jumbo LWB (L4H3, RWD, 2.0 EcoBlue 130PS) for full-time living and six-month-plus tours from Ireland to warmer European countries. Wet room with shower and toilet, side kitchen with diesel cooking, Dellonda 60 L dual-zone fridge, bike storage. Heating by a Tiger Exped 1.8 kW \"Sibirien\" diesel stove, which is gravity-fed and needs no electricity (its optional 12 V fuel pump is not modelled: no published power figure). The Euro 6 EcoBlue has a smart alternator, so alternator charging is via a DC-DC charger. Location set to Dublin with a December simulation, the hardest case; switch to Lisbon or Seville on the Solar page for touring months.",
